\"73-df-partial-value-conventions\">73-df-partial-value-conventions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§2.1.3–2.1.5, print pp. 39–44; PDF pp. 61–66; local partial-transition formalization"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"2"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i=1,2\">\\(i=1,2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q_i\">\\(Q_i\\)</span> 为非空有限状态集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_i\">\\(\\Sigma_i\\)</span> 为字母表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s_i\\in Q_i\">\\(s_i\\in Q_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\delta_i:Q_i\\times\\Sigma_i\\rightharpoonup Q_i\">\\(\\delta_i:Q_i\\times\\Sigma_i\\rightharpoonup Q_i\\)</span> 是部分函数图。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\Sigma_1\\cup\\Sigma_2\">\\(\\Sigma=\\Sigma_1\\cup\\Sigma_2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_i,q_i\\in Q_i\">\\(p_i,q_i\\in Q_i\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in\\Sigma\">\\(a\\in\\Sigma\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Q\\coloneqq Q_1\\times Q_2,\\qquad s\\coloneqq(s_1,s_2),\\qquad\\delta_\\parallel:Q\\times\\Sigma\\rightharpoonup Q.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Q\\coloneqq Q_1\\times Q_2,\\qquad s\\coloneqq(s_1,s_2),\\qquad\\delta_\\parallel:Q\\times\\Sigma\\rightharpoonup Q.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(((q_1,q_2),a),(p_1,p_2)\\bigr)\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^2\\bigl[(a\\notin\\Sigma_i\\land p_i=q_i)\\lor(a\\in\\Sigma_i\\land((q_i,a),p_i)\\in\\delta_i)\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\bigl(((q_1,q_2),a),(p_1,p_2)\\bigr)\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\n\\bigwedge_{i=1}^2\\bigl[(a\\notin\\Sigma_i\\land p_i=q_i)\\lor(a\\in\\Sigma_i\\land((q_i,a),p_i)\\in\\delta_i)\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R_\\parallel\\coloneqq\\{(q,p)\\in Q^2:\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;((q,a),p)\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Reach}_\\parallel\\coloneqq\\{p\\in Q:(s,p)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(R_\\parallel)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R_\\parallel\\coloneqq\\{(q,p)\\in Q^2:\\exists a\\in\\Sigma\\;((q,a),p)\\in\\delta_\\parallel\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Reach}_\\parallel\\coloneqq\\{p\\in Q:(s,p)\\in\\operatorname{RTC}_Q(R_\\parallel)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>动作不在某分量的字母表时，该分量忽略它；共享动作则须两个分量都启用。字母表内缺失的转移表示禁止动作，不能被误解为可忽略动作。部分函数的单值性逐分量传给乘积。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-path-closure","status":"resolved","id":"25902d0bd75ea963","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-path-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-partial-value-conventions","status":"resolved","id":"773cae915e5165f3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 